    "diagnosis": "Microcystic adnexal carcinoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Infiltrative, poorly circumscribed eccrine neoplasm with focal pilar differentiation (bilineage/divergent differentiation). Stratified growth pattern with microcysts in upper portion and smaller nests, trabeculae, and single cells at base. Nests of squamoid cells with minimal cytological atypia and duct formation in a sclerotic stroma. Perineural invasion and lymphoid aggregates are seen.",
